{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A premium survivors-like adventure combining challenging strategic combat, elaborate boss battles, captivating visual art, and an intricate storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fateful journey of a demon hunter who has overcome death begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fenrix is a demon hunter who achieved temporary immortality after making a pact with a certain angel. To prevent the archdemon from escaping, Fenrix heads for the mystical realm where the Asmodeus is sealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waiting for him there is Ariella, the enigmatic guardian who has been the sole protector of the seal for the last 500 years. Fenrix is gradually swept into her tragic fate, and an impending doom grows ever closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you defeat the unrelenting wave of enemies and deadly demons and alter the unstoppable course of fate? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Exhilarating Action to Rule the Battlefield </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customize your combat style with thrilling actions that cut down and blast away countless enemies, powerful impacts, captivating effects, and unique weapons. <br>Dominate the battlefield by sweeping past endless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/GIF_A.gif?t=1748493372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Heavenly Blessing and Limitless Strategies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Your journey is blessed by the abilities of unique angels!<br>Unlock powerful Awakening Skills by combining skills bestowed by angels and discover a universe of infinitely evolving strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/GIF_B.gif?t=1748493372\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overwhelming Boss Encounters </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Twisted Judicators of Fate who sold their souls to become demons for reasons of their own, obstruct your path with immense power and deadly attacks. <br>Achieve victory through meticulous planning, perfect timing, and the power of immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/GIF_C.gif?t=1748493372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Truth Concealed Beyond Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Death is not the end of the story, but a new beginning. The secrets of the universe gradually come to light through countless cycles of death and rebirth.<br>What deep, dark truths lie beyond the twisted web of fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/GIF_D.gif?t=1748493372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Stunning Visual Art </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A stunning yet delicately balanced setting, unique characters with vibrant colors and striking forms, and captivating visuals produced by outstanding visual effects and dynamic battles scenes await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/extras/BGSet00.gif?t=1748493372\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470500?t=1748493372","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470500?t=1748493372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470500/7c63416f8bae485e8af5cceb80200a7a54fbc04c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748493372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/